OL,3,GNEWSATory deputy answers BBC local
OL,4,Aradio questions on bin strike,
OL,5,Aelectoral losses and borrowing
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Conservative Party deputy leader
OL,8,Ftells BBC Radio Somerset that a
OL,9,F"positive vision for the country"
OL,10,Fshould be a priority
OL,12,FAlex Burghart is taking part in a
OL,13,Fseries of quick-fire interviews across
OL,14,Fsix BBC local radio stations
OL,16,FDiscussing the Birmingham bin strike
OL,17,Fwith BBC Radio WM, he says his party
OL,18,Fwould revisit the "crazy idea" that
OL,19,F"everybody has to be paid the same"
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
