OL,3,GNEWSATory deputy answers BBC local
OL,4,Aradio questions on bin strike,
OL,5,Aelectoral losses and borrowing
OL,6,
OL,7,FSpeaking to BBC Radio Kent, he also
OL,8,Fsays we "have to shake up" regulations
OL,9,Fon failing water companies but moving
OL,10,Fthem into public ownership "doesn't
OL,11,Factually fix the problem"
OL,13,FThe Conservatives are preparing to host
OL,14,Fthe party's autumn conference, which
OL,15,Fkicks off in Birmingham on Sunday
OL,17,FThe BBC local radio round has been a
OL,18,Fpre-conference tradition for many
OL,19,Fyears. Leaders of other major
OL,20,FWestminster parties have had a similar
OL,21,Fopportunity before their conferences
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
